          "text": "<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">2. Turn</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Help address risk factors of pressure injury</span></span></p>\n",
