          "text": "<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">3. Lift</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Safely transfer patient to the bedside chair</span></span></p>\n",
